# Nashmeira's Plea (ToAU 44), the Runic Seal. At Status 1 with the Mythril Mirror the _20m seal plays 405; update option
# 0; the finish with the cancelled option starts 116, finished with option 1 and INSTANCE_ID 7701: the char goes to
# Nyzul Isle (zone 77). The _20m seal's own finish makes the same xi.instance.onEventFinish call, so the trace does not
# show the mission's call alone; a fake check pins it.
lists AlzadaalUnderseaRuins/_20m/onTrigger AlzadaalUnderseaRuins/onEventFinish/116
char zone=AlzadaalUnderseaRuins pos=125,-2,20 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau NashmeirasPlea current
keyitem MythrilMirror
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
missionstatus Toau 1
trigger _20m
update 405 option=0
finish option=1073741824
tick 1000
finish option=1
tick 5000
